{"type":"event","event":{"type":"user/message","seq":9,"time":1793845113347,"data":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Current runtime context. This snapshot supersedes earlier runtime-context snapshots.\n\nCurrent working directory: \"/tmp/bot-p620/work/par2-list-and-weekday-2\".\n\nCurrent DSH file policy: workspace-write. Any available operation enforced by the DSH file sandbox may modify files under the session workspace: \"/tmp/bot-p620/work/par2-list-and-weekday-2\". Some platform temporary areas may also be writable.\n\nApproval prompts are enabled in this session: operations that require approval may ask through the configured answerers; without an available answerer, the request fails closed.\n\nCurrent DeepSeek Harness implementation checkout: \"/home/lingxufeng/bot/app/sdk/node_modules/.pnpm/@deepseek-ai+dsh-harness-dev-context@0.2.2-alpha.2_@deepseek-ai+cordis@4.0.6-alpha.1_@d_04a1a6141057631a395f02f7f5b2f8b0/\".\n\nCurrent DeepSeek Harness Web GUI URL: \"http://127.0.0.1:42057\"."}],"source":{"kind":"runtime-context","form":"snapshot","sections":[{"name":"working-directory:current","text":"Current working directory: \"/tmp/bot-p620/work/par2-list-and-weekday-2\"."},{"name":"sandbox:policy","text":"Current DSH file policy: workspace-write. Any available operation enforced by the DSH file sandbox may modify files under the session workspace: \"/tmp/bot-p620/work/par2-list-and-weekday-2\". Some platform temporary areas may also be writable."},{"name":"approval:policy","text":"Approval prompts are enabled in this session: operations that require approval may ask through the configured answerers; without an available answerer, the request fails closed."},{"name":"harness:source","text":"Current DeepSeek Harness implementation checkout: \"/home/lingxufeng/bot/app/sdk/node_modules/.pnpm/@deepseek-ai+dsh-harness-dev-context@0.2.2-alpha.2_@deepseek-ai+cordis@4.0.6-alpha.1_@d_04a1a6141057631a395f02f7f5b2f8b0/\"."},{"name":"app:web-surface","text":"Current DeepSeek